advanced.description:
{Advanced Summon Mummies}

Summons Mummies to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Mummies summoned is 50% greater than Basic Summon Mummies.

expert.description:
{Expert Summon Mummies}

Summons Mummies to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Mummies summoned is 100% greater than Basic Summon Mummies.
